==Hungarian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|hu|urj-pro|*-ta-}}. The preceding vowel, if any, is from the original [[stem]] of the root word.

===Suffix===
{{head|hu|suffix}}

# {{lb|hu|verb-forming suffix}} {{ng|Added to a [[noun]] to form a [[verb]]. Less frequently, it can also be found added onto other parts of speech.}}
#: {{afex|hu|só|t1=salt|pos1=noun|só'''z'''|t2=to salt}}
#: {{afex|hu|tiszta|t1=clean, clear|pos1=adjective|tisztá'''z'''|t2=to clarify}}
#: {{afex|hu|kettő|t1=two|pos1=numeral|kettő'''z'''|t2=to duplicate, to double}}
#: {{afex|hu|maga|t1=you|pos1=pronoun, formal|magá'''z'''|t2=to address someone formally}}
#: {{afex|hu|ide|t1=here, this way|pos1=adverb|idé'''z'''|t2=to summon}}
# {{lb|hu|obsolete|_|noun-forming suffix}} Found in {{m|hu|igaz}}, {{m|hu|száraz}}. See the main variant {{m|hu|-sz}}.

====Usage notes====
{{U:hu:verb-z}}

====Derived terms====
{{suffixsee|hu|pos=verb}}

